00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.730
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.560
<i>昨日までのルール今日はただのルーズ</i>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.560
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.560
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>こわして　タントツゴール</i>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<i>走りつづけてないと</i>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<i>他に意味はないと</i>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<i>パンクな哲学なんだ</i>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<i>バイオリズムは　ツーバイリズムで</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<i>風景は　瞬間に　無数の線</i>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<i>俺を取り巻く風</i>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Inside Outside 攻めて</i>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<i>いっさいがっさい　抜いて</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.720
<i>誰ひとりも　何ひとつも</i>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.720
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>前を　行かせたくはない</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.180
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>いっさいがっさい Yes! SONIC!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>アブナイヨと Have A Nice は似てる</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>そう　どちらも紙一重なのさ</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>タイクツ脱ぎ捨てて　今すぐかけだせ</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:39.880
This room...

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:46.100
It's here? I couldn't see the forest for the trees.

00:01:49.550 --> 00:01:51.480
How embarrassing!

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:03.430
Shadow? Why is he here?

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:04.910
Wasn't Shadow-

00:02:04.910 --> 00:02:07.340
I don't care if you snoop around the ship.

00:02:09.870 --> 00:02:13.530
But I can't allow you to touch this.

00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:16.540
So you knew I was on board this ship.

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:18.420
What's this all about?

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:23.170
Even someone as great as myself hasn't been able to wake him up yet.

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:26.140
Now, Sonic!

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:27.970
You're finished!

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:32.540
Attack!

00:02:38.770 --> 00:02:40.410
Sonic!

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:43.850
Sonic, it's all over for you!

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:50.160
Sonic!

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:59.620
No! Don't come this way, Chris!

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:01.330
Sonic!

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:04.980
Chris!

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:27.980
Chaos Control.

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:35.470
Chris!

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:00.070
That's...

00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:08.800
Chaos Emerald...

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:10.800
Shadow!

00:04:14.630 --> 00:04:17.250
Chaos Control.

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:22.590
Shadow...

00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:27.600
Episode 61

00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:27.600
The Metarex' Battleship Attack!

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:32.070
Metarex are coming! Do whatever it takes to protect the base!

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:42.270
It's Hellship!

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:46.940
Keep going! Fire!

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:02.290
All ships, fire all your laser guns at once!

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:16.510
Retreat!

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:21.600
How foolish of you to turn your backs on your enemy.

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:23.400
Respond, Hellship.

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:25.130
This is Hellship.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:31.850
Here's your new assignment. Destroy the blue hedgehog and egg-like man who keep interfering with our plans.

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:33.670
Yes, sir!

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:35.460
Well now...

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:40.180
You're not getting away!

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:57.190
What is it?

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:58.990
Even you, Cosmo?

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:00.170
What do you mean?

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:08.450
You're all thinking about Shadow?

00:06:08.450 --> 00:06:09.630
Yes...

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:20.200
Dr. Eggman's grandfather, Professor Gerald Robotnik, created Shadow as the ultimate life form.

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:26.010
He joined Eggman and battled against Sonic.

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:33.560
But in the end, he fought alongside Sonic and saved Chris's world. And then...

00:06:35.480 --> 00:06:38.630
You thought he was dead, but he's alive?

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:39.550
Yes.

00:06:39.550 --> 00:06:44.760
That's impossible. He couldn't have survived that fight.

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:50.030
But he wasn't wearing his limiter.

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:52.430
That means he survived!

00:06:58.170 --> 00:07:01.460
More importantly, why didn't he say hi?

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:04.260
Well, he never did have manners.

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:12.770
Why did he come to this world?

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:18.180
C'mon everyone, thinking isn't going to give us any answers.

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:20.780
Let's just ask him the next time we see him.

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:24.570
Sheesh...

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:33.800
Shadow!

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:37.330
How did they know my name?

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:40.890
Have we met before?

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:42.450
When? Where?

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:46.460
“When” is when you were in the humans' world.

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:49.780
“Where” is at Space Colony ARK.

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:51.250
You don't remember?

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:55.040
It's natural.

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:56.340
What do you mean?

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:57.790
I don't know.

00:07:57.790 --> 00:07:59.440
Stop playing dumb!

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:01.490
I'm not playing dumb.

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:09.740
Hmm... Hmm... Hmm...

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:14.490
I wonder if Dr. Eggman knows why Shadow lost his memory?

00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:30.920
Warp complete. Target verified. Now launching attack.

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:38.510
What's going on?

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:42.200
That stranger suddenly appeared and started attacking!

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:45.530
Metarex!

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:48.370
Raise the shields!

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:53.430
It's powerful!

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:55.490
The shields won't hold for much longer!

00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:58.990
Go, Shadow!

00:08:58.990 --> 00:09:01.730
Unless you don't want to learn about your past...

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:16.690
How dare they underestimate me. I'll show no mercy!

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:21.350
You're pretty good.

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:29.370
It's pointless!

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:31.050
In that case...

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:35.390
I said it was pointless!

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:42.160
Nice, Shadow!

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:43.980
What's going on?

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:45.340
Beats me.

00:09:45.340 --> 00:09:46.810
This is what's going on!

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:56.800
Shadow's Bounce Attack creates reverberations inside the Hellship, destroying it from the inside.

00:09:59.440 --> 00:10:03.340
Impossible! How does he have so much power?

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:21.420
This is bad! He used up all his power because he doesn't have a limiter!

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:22.610
What are you going to do?

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:25.180
I'll retrieve him for now!

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:32.270
You fools!

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:35.630
The missiles are heading straight for us!

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:37.040
Shoot them down!

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:44.970
They're all destroyed!

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:51.160
Target all weapons on Metarex!

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:04.100
I don't want to get involved.

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:05.260
Bye!

00:11:08.130 --> 00:11:10.120
We have to retreat!

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:11.300
Agreed!

00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:13.880
We'll escape using the Hard Boiled Drive!

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:15.760
Torpedo closing in!

00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:17.520
Unable to evade!

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:22.300
What?

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:32.420
The blue hedgehog is next!

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:48.470
What? You must be kidding!

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:51.310
I'm not kidding. Take a look.

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:03.610
What?

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:07.660
That's the one who attacked our ship!

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:18.210
Don't worry! We'll get your revenge!

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:22.340
Seriously? Even Shadow couldn't defeat it.

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:24.720
Shadow couldn't?

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:27.350
Let's retreat for now.

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:30.220
What? Is that captain's orders?

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:32.390
It's not an order, but...

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:37.770
We can always come back after analyzing its battle capabilities and properly arming ourselves!

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:40.730
That's true. I agree with Tails.

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:42.490
Not you too!

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:44.780
Calm down, Amy!

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:47.990
You, of all people, have no right to say that!

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:48.910
I agree.

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:51.370
How dare you!

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:53.370
Shadow...

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:56.250
There's no way he's dead.

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:57.960
Don't you agree?

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:04.050
Since he survived the ARK battle, he should be fine this time too.

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:06.050
Anyway, let's retreat for now!

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:07.390
I'm against that plan!

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:11.060
We no longer have time to discuss this!

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:14.890
It's here!

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:21.940
I want to get everyone's revenge.

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:22.940
But...

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:27.110
Let's retreat!

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:30.620
What are you talking about, Cosmo?

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:33.330
I thought you want to get everyone's revenge!

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:37.170
Revenge for your family, your friends, your entire race!

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:38.330
You're fine with leaving?

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:39.420
No!

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:45.880
But that doesn't mean I can put everyone in danger...

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:50.180
We're going to have to fight sooner or later.

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:53.270
So let's beat it now!

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:55.430
You're right.

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:59.440
It went through the trouble of coming to us, so let's do it!

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:00.150
Yeah!

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:02.020
Of course!

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:03.280
I'll do my best!

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:09.200
Are you all sure?

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.420
Interesting.

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.460
Turn on the shields!

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:24.420
Right!

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:30.720
How long can you withstand this attack?

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:35.140
...And that's the plan, okay?

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:36.350
Roger.

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:37.850
That's why you're the captain!

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:40.150
Chris! Are you ready?

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:41.560
Okay!

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:43.070
Here we go!

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:45.860
What?

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:53.240
Expand the shield! Change mode!

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:58.330
How lame.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:03.500
Firing cruise missile!

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:16.680
I don't know their location, but...

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:40.870
You're trying to trick me by pretending to be destroyed, but you can't fool me!

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:50.590
You don't have to be quiet anymore.

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:53.390
Because you have no chance of winning!

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:57.010
All right.

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:04.270
Congrats on escaping the trap, but it's a double trap!

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:06.820
Let's get started.

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:09.690
Give up and come out!

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:13.610
If you won't, I'm bombarding you with launcher missiles!

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:17.530
What?

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:20.910
You can no longer fire torpedoes either.

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:23.040
How dare you!

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:26.130
It's angry!

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:39.260
If you fire your guns when they're clogged, of course they explode!

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:42.940
You can no longer fight! Surrender!

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:44.690
Never!

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:49.230
It's on a collision course!

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:53.700
Run, Tails!

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:55.280
Emergency takeoff!

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:02.450
Damn! It's not powering up fast enough!

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:04.370
Reserve energy full throttle!

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:15.300
This is bad! They're going to crash!

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:20.560
Master Emerald can't give 100% of its energy unless I"m on board!

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:21.680
Everybody!

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:25.440
It's no good! I can't dodge it!

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:27.900
We're finished!

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:35.950
Shadow!

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:47.120
He wasn't dead.

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:50.670
But wasn't Eggman's ship destroyed?

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:56.970
It's not good enough to defeat me!

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:59.430
What happened was...

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:07.230
That's what happened.

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:09.360
See?

00:18:09.360 --> 00:18:11.690
We get it.

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:16.820
We used flashes and smoke screens to create the explosion.

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:20.240
Then we immediately warped using the Hard Boiled Drive!

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:23.160
By the way, where's Sonic?

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:30.170
It seems we have the same idea.

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:34.300
If we destroy its engine, it can no longer ram into our ship.

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:37.550
This is my prey. Stay out of it.

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:39.720
Sorry, but I can't do that.

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:45.220
It seems you know who I am.

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:48.850
Yeah, I know you. Don't you remember?

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:00.740
We did it!

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:06.160
Surrender and apologize to Cosmo!

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:08.750
There's nothing to apologize for.

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:14.170
What do you mean by that?

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:19.170
Everything I've done is to maintain order in the silent universe.

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:22.510
I'm only following Dark Oak's orders.

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:23.760
What?

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:27.770
Bad news! It's going to self-destruct!

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:29.230
We have to get out of here!

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:30.940
We don't have enough time!

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:34.900
Oh no!

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:37.070
Must I do everything?

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:40.900
Chaos Control!

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:50.370
What did you do?

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:54.710
I stopped its time flow. We have 90 seconds.

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:57.630
Begin countdown!

00:19:57.630 --> 00:20:01.090
85, 84, 83...

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:03.800
If there's something you want to do, make it quick.

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:04.720
Yeah!

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:06.600
Tails!

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:08.970
We have to use the Sonic Driver!

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:10.890
Sonic, come back immediately!

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:13.650
What are you planning to do with the Sonic Driver?

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:15.190
I'll explain later!

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:17.900
But more importantly, get the Master Drive ready, Chris!

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:19.110
Right!

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:22.400
63, 62, 61...

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:25.160
The Master Drive is ready!

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:28.620
Create a Drive Field behind Metarex!

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:29.500
Roger!

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:42.050
44, 43, 42...

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:49.680
Connecting energy to the cannon's hammer!

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:55.100
Pressurizing the cannon rod's ring energy!

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:57.270
Sonic, start your spin!

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:59.070
Okay!

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:05.320
Trigger safety off!

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:07.870
Targeting Metarex straight ahead!

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:08.990
Lock on!

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:11.120
Sonic Driver!

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:13.870
Fire!

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:20.750
5! 4! 3! 2! 1!

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:21.920
0!

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:39.520
I've lost! Forgive me, Dark Oak!

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:43.900
Hellship was destroyed?

00:22:15.270 --> 00:22:17.850
I've avenged the death of my people.

00:22:17.850 --> 00:22:20.480
But why am I not filled with joy?

00:22:20.480 --> 00:22:24.940
Is it because even though the enemy is destroyed, my people will never come back?

00:22:25.740 --> 00:22:27.360
Or is it because...

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:54.310
<i>私たちの世界は　魔法をかけられて</i>

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:54.310
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:54.310
<i><i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i></i>

